OL,3,ACanada and US say they are finalising a
OL,4,Atrade deal, but details remain murky
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanada and the US are finalising a
OL,7,Fhighly anticipated trade deal, with
OL,8,FPresident Donald Trump and Prime
OL,9,FMinister Mark Carney touting it as a
OL,10,Fsuccess.
OL,12,FTrump said the proposed deal will be
OL,13,Fwelcome by US farmers and
OL,14,Fmanufacturers, while Carney said it
OL,15,Fwill secure "the best terms" for
OL,16,FCanada's strategic sectors and provide
OL,17,Fcertainty on the future of US-Canada
OL,18,Ftrade.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
