OL,3,ACanada and US say they are finalising a
OL,4,Atrade deal, but details remain murky
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrade negotiators met on Wednesday for
OL,7,Fthe third time in as many days on
OL,8,FWednesday and after Trump paused a new
OL,9,Fwave of tariffs he had threatened to
OL,10,Fimpose overnight on a range of Canadian
OL,11,Fgoods.
OL,13,FBut details on what the agreement
OL,14,Fcovers, what concessions both sides
OL,15,Fhave made, and what still needs to be
OL,16,Fironed out, remain unclear.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
